  "steps": [
   "Put the plums in a small saucepan with the honey, vinegar and water. Cook over a medium heat for 8 to 10 minutes, stirring now and then, until the plums are soft and jammy but still hold their shape.",
   "Meanwhile, flake the mackerel into a bowl, picking out any bones as you go.",
   "Add the crème fraîche, horseradish and lemon juice and mash with a fork until spreadable but still a little chunky. Snip in most of the chives and season with plenty of black pepper.",
   "Toast the bread. Spread each slice thickly with the mackerel, then top with a few sprigs of watercress.",
   "Spoon over the warm plums and their juices, scatter with the rest of the chives and eat straight away."
